[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0010","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0020","text":"冬优子，能耽误你一下吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0030","text":"什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0033","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0040","text":"这个，不介意的话请收下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0050","text":"……按摩券？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0060","text":"你最近不是一直工作不断吗？\n算是感谢你这么努力的一点心意……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0070","text":"想着至少能让你喘口气\n或者缓解一下疲劳什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0080","text":"……什么意思啊\n说得好像我平时不努力似的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0090","text":"不，我不是那个意思……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21800300_02_0100","text":"……哦"}]
